          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi hao watu wakatwaa zawadi ile, wakatwaa na fedha maradufu mikononi mwao, na Benyamini; wakaondoka, wakashuka mpaka Misri, wakasimama mbele ya Yusufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.24.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwa 24:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.39.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "39:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naye Yusufu alipomwona Benyamini pamoja nao, akamwambia msimamizi wa nyumba yake, Uwalete watu hawa nyumbani, ukachinje mnyama na kuwaandalia, maana watu hawa watakula pamoja nami adhuhuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mtu akafanya kama Yusufu alivyomwambia Naye akawaleta watu hao nyumbani mwa Yusufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini watu hao wakaogopa kwa sababu wameletwa nyumbani mwa Yusufu, wakasema, Kwa sababu ya fedha zile zilizorudishwa katika magunia yetu mara ya kwanza tumeletwa humu; apate kutushitaki, na kutushika, atutwae sisi kuwa watumwa, na punda wetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
