        },
        {
          "text": " Akainua macho yake, akamwona Benyamini, nduguye, mwana wa mama yake, akasema, Huyu ndiye ndugu yenu mdogo, mliyeniambia habari zake? Akasema, Mungu akufadhili, mwanangu. ",
